      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't even know why im typing this. just feels like i'm running on empty and there's no way to refill it. everything i worked for is just... gone. the debt, the burnout, the feeling that im just letting everyone down constantly. i'm just so tired of trying to fix things that are fundamentally broken.",
