    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"stop fighting the current\"... i dont know. it just feels like if i stop fighting, i'm just going to sink. and i've already sunk so far. it feels like no matter what i do, the debt and the expectations just keep piling up. i'm just stuck in this loop of misery and i can't see any version of the future where things actually get better. it feels more like a trap than a life.",
