      "content": "what do you mean by \"self-cancellation\"? it feels like you're saying there's no point in even trying to fix the mess anymore. like, even if i take a break, the debt and the failure will just be waiting for me when i get back. it's like you're saying the only real way to get peace is to just... stop. completely.",
